**/packs/**/LOG
**/packs/**/LOG.old
**/packs/**/*.log

# Keep data files
!**/packs/**/*.ldb
!**/packs/**/CURRENT
!**/packs/**/MANIFEST-*

# Zip files for releases
*.zip

